m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074540/extras/240901064ff3f17975e51820a01a8dca.avif?t=1668651603\" width=800 height=160 /></span><br>While this may seem beneficial on the surface, they may just lead to you downfall. The reasoning for this being enemies may just be attracted to the origins of these sounds, meaning you have to choose, either get complete understanding of your environment and lure your captors towards you, or stay hidden in the shadows, but not know what surrounds you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074540/extras/46a992f75f4d18a0eb068d372e133645.avif?t=1668651603\" width=800 height=160 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2074540?t=1668651603","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1668651603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1668651603","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1668651603","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2090010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074540/extras/2544b747c2039ebbd8fe85c69f1c8985.avif?t=1668651603\" width=316 height=150 /></span><br>You wake up in a cell, the smell of dust fills your lungs. You try to look around and get your barring, but can only see the inky blackness of the void surrounding you. The holes where your eyes should be begin to tear, as you scream out for help. Will you be able to escape and solve the mystery, or will you be doomed to join the other's fate?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\